#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b><u>ATTENTION:</u></b> This feature must be enabled manually. Navigate to "
"your settings and turn on <b>Inventory / Operations / Product Conversion</"
"b>. Please note that this activates extra code and may impact your "
"subscription."
msgstr ""
"<b><u>ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງ:</u></b> ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ "
"ແລ້ວເປີດ <b>ສາງສິນຄ້າ / ການດຳເນີນງານ / ການແປງສະພາບສິນຄ້າ</b>. "
"ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂຄ້ດເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ອາດມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຄ່າບໍລິການລົງທະບຽນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b><u>Using Multiple BOMs</u></b>"
msgstr "<b><u>ການນຳໃຊ້ຫຼາຍ BOM</u></b>"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>A key tip:</b> Don't create a new product for each order. Instead, use a "
"generic product and differentiate it using the <b>lot number</b>. You can "
"then link the correct production order to the right delivery."
msgstr ""
"<b>ເຄັດລັບສຳຄັນ:</b> ບໍ່ຄວນສ້າງສິນຄ້າໃໝ່ສຳລັບທຸກໆໃບສັ່ງຊື້. ແຕ່ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສິນຄ້າທົ່ວໄປ "
"ແລ້ວຈຳແນກຄວາມຕ່າງໂດຍໃຊ້ <b>ໝາຍເລກຊຸດ (lot number)</b>. "
"ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມໂຍງໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເຂົ້າກັບການຈັດສົ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໄດ້."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid ""
"<b>Athletic Fit:</b> Designed to fit close to the body, often with raglan "
"sleeves, to allow for movement"
msgstr ""
"<b>ຊົງກິລາ (Athletic Fit):</b> ອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຮ່າງກາຍ, ມັກຈະມີແຂນເສື້ອແບບ raglan "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຄື່ອນໄຫວໄດ້ສະດວກ"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Automatically</b> if the available stock falls below the minimum level "
"set in the <b>Reordering Rule</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ</b> ຖ້າສິນຄ້າໃນສາງທີ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ຫຼຸດລົງຕໍ່າກວ່າລະດັບຂັ້ນຕໍ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ "
"<b>ກົດການສັ່ງຊື້ຄືນ</b>."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>BOM 1: Full Fabrication</b> This BOM would include all raw materials, "
"like the fabric and thread, to make the T-shirt from scratch."
msgstr ""
"<b>BOM 1: ການຜະລິດແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບ</b> BOM ນີ້ຈະຮວມເອົາວັດຖຸດິບທັງໝົດ, ເຊັ່ນ: ແພ ແລະ ຝ້າຍຫຍິບ, "
"ເພື່ອຜະລິດເສື້ອຢືດຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>BOM 2: Reusing Stock</b> This BOM would be used if you already have plain "
"T-shirts in stock. It would only include the components needed to add the "
"logo."
msgstr ""
"<b>BOM 2: ການນຳໃຊ້ສິນຄ້າໃນສາງຄືນ</b> BOM ນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານມີເສື້ອຢືດລ້າໆຢູ່ໃນສາງແລ້ວ. "
"ມັນຈະຮວມພຽງແຕ່ອົງປະກອບທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການຕິດໂລໂກ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Blue Cotton</b>: Only applies to the \"Blue\" T-shirt variant."
msgstr "<b>ຜ້າຝ້າຍສີຟ້າ</b>: ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບເສື້ອຢືດລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍ \"ສີຟ້າ\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid ""
"<b>Boat Neck:</b> A wide, straight neckline that runs horizontally across "
"the collarbone."
msgstr "<b>ຄໍເຮືອ (Boat Neck):</b> ຄໍເສື້ອກວ້າງ ແລະ ຊື່ ທີ່ພາດຜ່ານຕາມແນວນອນຂອງກະດູກໄຫປາຣ້າ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>By-products:</b> Manage leftovers from production and track them as "
"valuable inventory."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຜະລິດຕະພັນພອຍໄດ້ (By-products):</b> ຈັດການເສດເຫຼືອຈາກການຜະລິດ ແລະ "
"ຕິດຕາມໃຫ້ເປັນສິນຄ້າໃນສາງທີ່ມີມູນຄ່າ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Clothing Label</b>: Applies to both variants (when setting is empty)"
msgstr "<b>ປ້າຍເສື້ອຜ້າ</b>: ໃຊ້ກັບທັງສອງລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍ (ເມື່ອການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫວ່າງເປົ່າ)"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Component List</b>:"
msgstr "<b>ລາຍການອົງປະກອບ</b>:"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Connected Printers:</b> Set up automated label printing."
msgstr "<b>ເຄື່ອງພິມທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່:</b> ຕັ້ງຄ່າການພິມປ້າຍແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Create BOMs for a single unit:</b> It's often easier to define your Bill "
"of Materials for just one unit."
msgstr ""
"<b>ສ້າງ BOM ສຳລັບໜຶ່ງຫົວໜ່ວຍ:</b> ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແລ້ວການກຳນົດລາຍການວັດຖຸດິບ (BOM) "
"ສຳລັບໜຶ່ງຫົວໜ່ວຍຈະເຮັດໄດ້ງ່າຍກວ່າ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid "<b>Crew Neck (Round Neck):</b> The most classic and popular style."
msgstr "<b>ຄໍມົນ (Crew Neck):</b> ແບບທີ່ຄລາສສິກ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມນິຍົມຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Destination Location:</b> If you have more than 1 internal location set "
"up on your inventory, you can choose the destination location as well."
msgstr ""
"<b>ສະຖານທີ່ປາຍທາງ:</b> ຖ້າທ່ານມີສະຖານທີ່ພາຍໃນຫຼາຍກວ່າ 1 ແຫ່ງທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃນສາງ, "
"ທ່ານກໍສາມາດເລືອກສະຖານທີ່ປາຍທາງໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Detailed Logging:</b> A record of the conversion is automatically posted "
"to the <b>Chatter</b> of both the Transfer and the Manufacturing Order."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການບັນທຶກລະອຽດ:</b> ບັນທຶກການແປງສະພາບຈະຖືກໂພສລົງໃນ <b>Chatter</b> ຂອງທັງໃບໂອນຍ້າຍ "
"ແລະ ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Direct Integration: </b> Add all the details directly to the "
"manufacturing operations."
msgstr "<b>ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງໂດຍກົງ: </b> ເພີ່ມລາຍລະອຽດທັງໝົດເຂົ້າໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການຜະລິດໂດຍກົງ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid ""
"<b>Dolman/Batwing Sleeve:</b> A very loose sleeve that gets narrower at the "
"wrist."
msgstr ""
"<b>ແຂນເສື້ອປີກເຈຍ (Dolman/Batwing):</b> ແຂນເສື້ອກວ້າງຫຼາຍທີ່ຄ່ອຍໆຮຽວແຄບລົງມາຮອດຂໍ້ມື."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Dropshipping route:</b> Enable this for products that are shipped "
"directly from a supplier's location to another destination without ever "
"entering your warehouse."
msgstr ""
"<b>ເສັ້ນທາງ Dropshipping:</b> "
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານສິ່ງນີ້ສຳລັບສິນຄ້າທີ່ຈັດສົ່ງໂດຍກົງຈາກຜູ້ສະໜອງໄປຫາປາຍທາງອື່ນ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຜ່ານເຂົ້າມາໃນສາງຂອງທ່ານເລີຍ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Error Prevention:</b> This guardrail ensures users only convert products "
"into eligible alternatives, preventing manual data entry errors."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການປ້ອງກັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ:</b> "
"ລະບົບປ້ອງກັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະແປງສະພາບສິນຄ້າເປັນລາຍການອື່ນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈາກການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid "<b>Fit:</b>"
msgstr "<b>ຮູບຊົງ:</b>"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>For Engineer-to-Order (ETO):</b> From the CRM, create a new project by "
"clicking the <b>⚙️ icon</b> and selecting a template. This project will allow "
"you to manage all the pre-sales steps, such as:"
msgstr ""
"<b>ສຳລັບ Engineer-to-Order (ETO):</b> ຈາກ CRM, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໂຄງການໃໝ່ໂດຍການກົດທີ່ "
"<b>ໄອຄອນ ⚙️</b> ແລ້ວເລືອກແມ່ແບບ. ໂຄງການນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຄຸ້ມຄອງທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນການຂາຍໄດ້ "
"ເຊັ່ນ:"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>For Make-to-Stock (MTS) or Make-to-Order (MTO) Products:</b> Simply "
"create a quote with the correct product. When the customer confirms it, Odoo "
"will automatically create a delivery order. Whether a production order is "
"also\n"
"                    created depends on your settings, which are detailed in "
"the <b>Manufacturing Order Creation</b> section."
msgstr ""
"<b>ສຳລັບສິນຄ້າແບບ Make-to-Stock (MTS) ຫຼື Make-to-Order (MTO):</b> "
"ພຽງແຕ່ສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາພ້ອມສິນຄ້າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເມື່ອລູກຄ້າຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ, Odoo "
"ຈະສ້າງໃບສົ່ງມອບສິນຄ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ສ່ວນໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນນຳຫຼືບໍ່ນັ້ນ\n"
"                    ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ, ເຊິ່ງມີລາຍລະອຽດຢູ່ໃນພາກ "
"<b>ການສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ</b>."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid ""
"<b>Henley:</b> A crew neck with a placket of a few buttons, often without a "
"collar."
msgstr "<b>ຄໍເຮນລີ (Henley):</b> ເສື້ອຄໍມົນທີ່ມີສາບກະດຸມສອງສາມເມັດ, ສ່ວນຫຼາຍມັກຈະບໍ່ມີຄໍເສື້ອ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid "<b>High Quality Cotton T-shirt available in the following variants:</b>"
msgstr "<b>ເສື້ອຢືດຜ້າຝ້າຍຄຸນນະພາບສູງ ມີໃຫ້ເລືອກໃນລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:</b>"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>History Preservation:</b> By using a background MO, the <b>Traceability "
"Report</b> remains unbroken. You can view the entire history of the new "
"product, including its previous form."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຮັກສາປະຫວັດ:</b> ດ້ວຍການໃຊ້ MO ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງ, <b>ລາຍງານການຕິດຕາມຍ້ອນຮອຍ</b> "
"ຈະບໍ່ຂາດຕອນ. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງປະຫວັດທັງໝົດຂອງສິນຄ້າໃໝ່ ລວມທັງຮູບແບບເດີມກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໄດ້."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Inventory Presence:</b> The transfer must not be a Receipt or Dropship. "
"(Products must be physically in stock before they can be converted)."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການມີຢູ່ໃນສາງ:</b> ການໂອນຍ້າຍຕ້ອງບໍ່ແມ່ນການຮັບສິນຄ້າເຂົ້າ (Receipt) ຫຼື Dropship. "
"(ສິນຄ້າຕ້ອງມີຕົວຕົນຢູ່ໃນສາງກ່ອນ ຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດແປງສະພາບໄດ້)."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Keep Lot/SN:</b> If checked, the new product inherits the existing Lot/"
"Serial Number (e.g., new \"T-shirt (Quality Refurbished, Yellow)\" retains "
"the original \"LOT1\")."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຮັກສາ Lot/SN ໄວ້:</b> ຖ້າໝາຍຕິກ, ສິນຄ້າໃໝ່ຈະສືບທອດເລກ Lot/Serial ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"\"ເສື້ອຢືດ (ປັບປຸງຄຸນນະພາບ, ສີເຫຼືອງ)\" ໃໝ່ ຈະຍັງຮັກສາ \"LOT1\" ເດີມໄວ້)."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Link to a Knowledge Page:</b> Gather all the information in a separate "
"knowledge page and then link that page to the manufacturing instructions. "
"This keeps the operations clean while providing all the\n"
"                                    necessary details."
msgstr ""
"<b>ເຊື່ອມໂຍງໄປຫາໜ້າຄວາມຮູ້ (Knowledge Page):</b> ຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດໄວ້ໃນໜ້າຄວາມຮູ້ຕ່າງຫາກ "
"ແລ້ວເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໜ້ານັ້ນເຂົ້າກັບຄຳແນະນຳໃນການຜະລິດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກກະທັດຮັດ "
"ພ້ອມທັງໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນ\n"
"                                    ທີ່ຈຳເປັນຢ່າງຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Location Accuracy:</b> The MO pulls from the exact \"Pick From\" location "
"to ensure inventory balance."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງສະຖານທີ່:</b> MO ຈະດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກສະຖານທີ່ \"ເລືອກຈາກ\" (Pick From) "
"ທີ່ແນ່ນອນ ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຄວາມສົມດຸນຂອງສິນຄ້າໃນສາງ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Make to Order (MTO):</b> Enable this if you want replenishment to be "
"automatically triggered whenever a sales order or production order is "
"validated."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຜະລິດເມື່ອມີການສັ່ງຊື້ (MTO):</b> ເປີດໃຊ້ງານສິ່ງນີ້ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ລະບົບເຕີມສິນຄ້າອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ເມື່ອມີການຢືນຢັນໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ ຫຼື ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Manually</b> if the product doesn't have a Reordering Rule and there is "
"no stock available."
msgstr "<b>ແບບກຳນົດເອງ</b> ຖ້າສິນຄ້າບໍ່ມີກົດການສັ່ງຊື້ຄືນ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີສິນຄ້າເຫຼືອຢູ່ໃນສາງ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Manufacturing 2 steps:</b> Your current \"Manufacturing 1 step\" workflow "
"takes components directly from stock. By switching to a 2-step process, "
"you'll add a picking operation between your warehouse and production\n"
"                                area. This is ideal for transferring entire "
"packages, like a full bobbin of thread, rather than just a small portion."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຜະລິດ 2 ຂັ້ນຕອນ:</b> ຂະບວນການ \"ການຜະລິດ 1 ຂັ້ນຕອນ\" "
"ປະຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນຈະເບີກອົງປະກອບຈາກສາງໂດຍກົງ. ເມື່ອປ່ຽນມາໃຊ້ຂະບວນການ 2 ຂັ້ນຕອນ, "
"ທ່ານຈະເພີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການເບີກເຄື່ອງລະຫວ່າງສາງ ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ຜະລິດ.\n"
"                                ສິ່ງນີ້ເໝາະສຳລັບການໂອນຍ້າຍແບບຍົກແພັກ, ເຊັ່ນ: ກໍ້ດ້າຍເຕັມກໍ້ "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະຕັດແບ່ງພຽງສ່ວນນ້ອຍ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Manufacturing 3 steps:</b> If you need a dedicated storage step for "
"finished products, change your warehouse settings to a 3-step workflow. This "
"adds a final transfer step, moving completed items from the\n"
"                                production area to their final storage "
"location."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຜະລິດ 3 ຂັ້ນຕອນ:</b> ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂັ້ນຕອນຈັດເກັບສະເພາະສຳລັບສິນຄ້າສຳເລັດຮູບ, "
"ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສາງເປັນຂະບວນການ 3 ຂັ້ນຕອນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການໂອນຍ້າຍສຸດທ້າຍ "
"ຄືຍ້າຍສິນຄ້າທີ່ຜະລິດແລ້ວຈາກ\n"
"                                ພື້ນທີ່ຜະລິດ ໄປຍັງສະຖານທີ່ຈັດເກັບສຸດທ້າຍ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid ""
"<b>Material:</b> Crafted from 100% Ring-Spun Combed Cotton for superior "
"softness and durability. Our t-shirts are pre-shrunk to ensure a consistent "
"fit."
msgstr ""
"<b>ວັດສະດຸ:</b> ຜະລິດຈາກຜ້າຝ້າຍ Combed Cotton 100% ເພື່ອຄວາມນຸ່ມນວນ ແລະ ທົນທານເປັນພິເສດ. "
"ເສື້ອຢືດຂອງພວກເຮົາຜ່ານການປ້ອງກັນການຫົດຕົວມາແລ້ວ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮັກສາຂະໜາດທີ່ພໍດີສະເໝີ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Multi-Step Operations:</b> Choose a 1, 2, or 3-step process for receiving "
"and shipping goods in your <b>Warehouse Settings</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການດຳເນີນງານຫຼາຍຂັ້ນຕອນ:</b> ເລືອກຂະບວນການແບບ 1, 2, ຫຼື 3 ຂັ້ນຕອນ ສຳລັບການຮັບ ແລະ "
"ການຈັດສົ່ງສິນຄ້າໃນ <b>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສາງສິນຄ້າ</b>."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>New Lot/SN:</b> If \"Keep\" is unchecked, users can manually assign a new "
"Lot/Serial Number."
msgstr ""
"<b>Lot/SN ໃໝ່:</b> ຖ້າບໍ່ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ \"ຮັກສາໄວ້\", ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດກຳນົດໝາຍເລກ Lot/Serial "
"ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Note:</b> If you validate a transfer for a partial quantity, the system "
"will automatically create a <b>backorder</b> for the rest of the items."
msgstr ""
"<b>ໝາຍເຫດ:</b> ຖ້າທ່ານຢືນຢັນການໂອນຍ້າຍພຽງຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ, ລະບົບຈະສ້າງ <b>ລາຍການຄ້າງສົ່ງ "
"(backorder)</b> ສຳລັບສິນຄ້າສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Operational Status:</b> The transfer must be in a state other than "
"\"Draft\" or \"Done.\""
msgstr ""
"<b>ສະຖານະການດຳເນີນງານ:</b> ການໂອນຍ້າຍຕ້ອງບໍ່ຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະ \"ຮ່າງ\" (Draft) ຫຼື \"ສຳເລັດ\" "
"(Done)"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Package Types:</b> Track specific types of packages."
msgstr "<b>ປະເພດຫີບຫໍ່:</b> ຕິດຕາມປະເພດສະເພາະຂອງຫີບຫໍ່."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid "<b>Polo Collar:</b> A two-button placket and a soft, folded collar."
msgstr "<b>ຄໍໂປໂລ:</b> ມີສາບກະດຸມສອງເມັດ ແລະ ຄໍພັບແບບນຸ່ມ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Pro-Tip:</b> You can print and use barcode commands with a scanner to "
"automate and streamline your workflow."
msgstr ""
"<b>ເຄັດລັບພິເສດ:</b> ທ່ານສາມາດພິມ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງບາໂຄດຮ່ວມກັບເຄື່ອງສະແກນ "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກເປັນອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ຄ່ອງຕົວຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Quantity Validation:</b> The system prevents converting more than the "
"maximum available stock for that specific Quant."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການກວດສອບຈຳນວນ:</b> ລະບົບຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ແປງສະພາບເກີນຈຳນວນສູງສຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນສາງສຳລັບຈຳນວນນັ້ນ "
"(Quant)."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid ""
"<b>Raglan Sleeve:</b> Extends in one piece to the collar, creating a "
"diagonal seam."
msgstr "<b>ແຂນເສື້ອແບບ Raglan:</b> ຕັດຕໍ່ເປັນຊິ້ນດຽວຍາວຂຶ້ນໄປຮອດຄໍເສື້ອ, ເກີດເປັນຮອຍຫຍິບສະຫຼຽງ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid "<b>Regular/Classic Fit:</b> A standard, comfortable, and timeless fit."
msgstr "<b>ຊົງມາດຕະຖານ/ຄລາສສິກ:</b> ຊົງມາດຕະຖານ ໃສ່ສະບາຍ ແລະ ບໍ່ຕົກຍຸກ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid ""
"<b>Relaxed/Oversized Fit:</b> A looser, more casual fit that is currently "
"popular in streetwear."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຊົງຫຼວມ/ໂອເວີໄຊສ໌ (Oversized):</b> ຊົງຫຼວມ ສະບາຍໆ ເຊິ່ງກຳລັງເປັນທີ່ນິຍົມໃນແຟຊັ່ນສະຕຣີດ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Restricted Mapping:</b> If a product uses an attribute marked \"Convert "
"Attribute,\" the user is limited to selecting variants within that specific "
"attribute group."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຈັບຄູ່ແບບຈຳກັດ:</b> ຖ້າສິນຄ້າໃດໃຊ້ຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ໝາຍວ່າ \"ແປງຄຸນລັກສະນະ (Convert "
"Attribute)\", ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໃຫ້ເລືອກສະເພາະລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍພາຍໃນກຸ່ມຄຸນລັກສະນະນັ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid ""
"<b>Scoop Neck:</b> A wider, U-shaped neckline, more common in women's styles."
msgstr "<b>ຄໍກວ້າງຕົວຢູ (Scoop Neck):</b> ຄໍເສື້ອກວ້າງເປັນຮູບຕົວ U ເຊິ່ງພົບເຫັນຫຼາຍໃນເສື້ອຜ້າຜູ້ຍິງ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid ""
"<b>Set-in Sleeve:</b> The standard sleeve that is sewn into the armhole seam."
msgstr "<b>ແຂນເສື້ອມາດຕະຖານ (Set-in Sleeve):</b> ແຂນເສື້ອມາດຕະຖານທີ່ຫຍິບຕິດເຂົ້າກັບວົງແຂນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Shipping Connectors:</b> Integrate directly with shipping carriers."
msgstr "<b>ຕົວເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ການຂົນສົ່ງ:</b> ເຊື່ອມໂຍງໂດຍກົງກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂົນສົ່ງ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid "<b>Sleeve Cut:</b>"
msgstr "<b>ຮູບຊົງແຂນເສື້ອ:</b>"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid ""
"<b>Slim/Modern Fit:</b> Tapered through the chest and waist for a more "
"tailored look."
msgstr "<b>ຊົງສະລິມ/ທັນສະໄໝ:</b> ເຂົ້າຮູບຊ່ວງເອິກ ແລະ ແອວ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງພໍດີຕົວສວຍງາມ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Source Details:</b> Displays the product and the specific <b>\"Pick "
"From\"</b>  (the quant), including the location and the selected Lot or "
"Serial Number."
msgstr ""
"<b>ລາຍລະອຽດຕົ້ນທາງ:</b> ສະແດງສິນຄ້າ ແລະ ຈຸດສະເພາະ <b>\"ເລືອກຈາກ\"</b> (ຈຳນວນ/"
"quant), ຮວມທັງສະຖານທີ່ ແລະ ໝາຍເລກ Lot ຫຼື Serial ທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Steps to adjust:</b>"
msgstr "<b>ຂັ້ນຕອນການປັບປ່ຽນ:</b>"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Storable Products:</b> Only products with \"Track Inventory\" enabled are "
"eligible."
msgstr ""
"<b>ສິນຄ້າທີ່ສາມາດເກັບໃນສາງໄດ້:</b> ສະເພາະສິນຄ້າທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ \"ຕິດຕາມສິນຄ້າຄົງສາງ\" "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>T-shirt (Finished Product)</b>: Has two variants, \"Blue\" and \"Yellow.\""
msgstr "<b>ເສື້ອຢືດ (ສິນຄ້າສຳເລັດຮູບ)</b>: ມີສອງລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍ ຄື \"ສີຟ້າ\" ແລະ \"ສີເຫຼືອງ\""

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Tips for Changing Production Priorities: </b>If you need to change the "
"priority on your production plan, you'll have to re-plan the entire "
"schedule. First, select all the <b>Manufacturing Orders</b> and \"Unplan\" "
"them.\n"
"                        Next, set the new priority (⭐) for the orders you "
"need to adjust, then \"Re-plan\" everything. This will ensure your new "
"priorities are reflected in the schedule."
msgstr ""
"<b>ເຄັດລັບໃນການປ່ຽນລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງການຜະລິດ: </"
"b>ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນໃນແຜນການຜະລິດ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງວາງແຜນຕາຕະລາງໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ. ທຳອິດ, "
"ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <b>ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ</b> ທັງໝົດ ແລ້ວກົດ \"ຍົກເລີກການວາງແຜນ\" (Unplan).\n"
"                        ຕໍ່ມາ, ຕັ້ງຄ່າລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນໃໝ່ (⭐) ສຳລັບໃບສັ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປັບ, "
"ແລ້ວກົດ \"ວາງແຜນໃໝ່\" (Re-plan) ທັງໝົດ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຖືກອັບເດດໃນຕາຕະລາງ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Traceability Management:</b>"
msgstr "<b>ການຄຸ້ມຄອງການຕິດຕາມຍ້ອນຮອຍ:</b>"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Traceability Matching:</b> The system intelligently filters \"Convert "
"Into\" options based on tracing. For example, if you convert a Lot-tracked "
"item and provide a new Lot number, the destination product must also support "
"Lot tracking. But if you dont provide any Lot Number, only product without "
"specific traceability will be eligible for convert into."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຈັບຄູ່ການຕິດຕາມຍ້ອນຮອຍ:</b> ລະບົບຈະກັ່ນຕອງຕົວເລືອກ \"ແປງເປັນ\" "
"ຢ່າງຊານສະຫຼາດໂດຍອີງຕາມການຕິດຕາມ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າທ່ານແປງສິນຄ້າທີ່ມີການຕິດຕາມແບບ Lot ແລະ "
"ລະບຸໝາຍເລກ Lot ໃໝ່, ສິນຄ້າປາຍທາງກໍຕ້ອງຮອງຮັບການຕິດຕາມແບບ Lot ເຊັ່ນກັນ. "
"ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸໝາຍເລກ Lot ໃດໆ, "
"ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ສິນຄ້າທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຕິດຕາມສະເພາະເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະສາມາດແປງເປັນໄດ້."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Use the batch size setting:</b> If you always produce in batches of a "
"specific quantity, use the <b>Batch Size</b> setting in the "
"<b>Miscellaneous</b> tab."
msgstr ""
"<b>ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຊຸດຜະລິດ (Batch Size):</b> ຖ້າທ່ານຜະລິດເປັນຊຸດຕາມຈຳນວນທີ່ແນ່ນອນສະເໝີ, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ <b>ຂະໜາດຊຸດ (Batch Size)</b> ໃນແທັບ <b>ອື່ນໆ (Miscellaneous)</b>."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_14
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_15
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_3
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:textile_manufacturing.product_template_4
msgid "<b>V-Neck:</b> A \"V\" shaped neckline that can be shallow or deep."
msgstr "<b>ຄໍວີ (V-Neck):</b> ຄໍເສື້ອເປັນຮູບຕົວ \"V\" ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະຕື້ນ ຫຼື ເລິກກໍໄດ້."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Variant Control &amp; Error Prevention</b>"
msgstr "<b>ການຄວບຄຸມລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍ &amp; ການປ້ອງກັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ</b>"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Work Center Capacity:</b> Optimize your production schedule by exploring "
"the capacity of your work centers."
msgstr ""
"<b>ກຳລັງການຜະລິດຂອງສູນປະຕິບັດງານ:</b> ປັບປຸງຕາຕະລາງການຜະລິດຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດ "
"ໂດຍການກວດສອບກຳລັງການຜະລິດຂອງສູນປະຕິບັດງານ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Yellow Cotton</b>: Only applies to the \"Yellow\" T-shirt variant."
msgstr "<b>ຜ້າຝ້າຍສີເຫຼືອງ</b>: ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບເສື້ອຢືດລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍ \"ສີເຫຼືອງ\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<em>When you shop with us, you're not just buying yardage. You're helping "
"preserve a small, beautiful piece of Scottish textile history for its next "
"chapter.</em>\n"
"                                    <br/>"
msgstr ""
"<em>ເມື່ອທ່ານເລືອກຊື້ສິນຄ້າກັບພວກເຮົາ, ທ່ານບໍ່ພຽງແຕ່ຊື້ແຜ່ນແພເທົ່ານັ້ນ "
