msgstr "ໜ້າຫຼັກ"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.view_page_about_us
msgid "How it Started"
msgstr "ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If a <b>Sales Order</b> exists for the pattern, the delivery will be created "
"automatically. Otherwise, you must create the delivery for the client "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າມີ <b>ໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ</b> ສຳລັບແບບຕັດນັ້ນ, ການສົ່ງມອບຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງການສົ່ງມອບໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If a Manufacturing Order is planned and all necessary components are "
"available, it will appear on your screen."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດຖືກວາງແຜນໄວ້ ແລະ ມີອົງປະກອບທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດພ້ອມແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນເທິງໜ້າຈໍຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If any materials are required, use the <b>Purchase app</b> to manage your "
"purchase orders."
msgstr "ຖ້າຕ້ອງການວັດສະດຸໃດໆ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ <b>ແອັບການຈັດຊື້</b> ເພື່ອຄຸ້ມຄອງໃບສັ່ງຊື້ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If needed, you can pack the products together to generate a single label for "
"the entire package."
msgstr "ຖ້າຕ້ອງການ, ທ່ານສາມາດລວມສິນຄ້າເຂົ້າກັນໃນຫີບຫໍ່ດຽວ ເພື່ອສ້າງປ້າຍດຽວສຳລັບທັງໝົດຊຸດ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If the product has <b>variants</b> (like different sizes or colors), you'll "
"need to create them on the dedicated tab. Be careful to read the "
"documentation first to ensure you configure them correctly."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າສິນຄ້າມີ <b>ລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍ</b> (ເຊັ່ນ: ຂະໜາດ ຫຼື ສີທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ), ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງສ້າງພວກມັນໃນແທັບສະເພາະ. "
"ກະລຸນາອ່ານເອກະສານແນະນຳກ່ອນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າພວກມັນໄດ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If traceability is required for certain products, change the tracking method "
"to <b>Lots</b> or <b>Serial Numbers</b>."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕາມຍ້ອນຮອຍສຳລັບບາງສິນຄ້າ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນວິທີການຕິດຕາມເປັນ <b>Lot</b> ຫຼື <b>Serial "
"Number</b>."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you have a knowledge page to centralize product customization, you can "
"link it in the notes section of the <b>Miscellaneous</b> tab."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານມີໜ້າຄວາມຮູ້ສຳລັບຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນການປັບແຕ່ງສິນຄ້າ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ມັນໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນບັນທຶກຂອງແທັບ "
"<b>ອື່ນໆ (Miscellaneous)</b>."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you have activated the demo data, you can test the complete workflow by "
"printing this"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດທົດສອບຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກທັງໝົດໄດ້ໂດຍການພິມອັນນີ້"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"In this database's demo data, the <b>Reordering Rules</b> are set to a "
"<b>\"Manual\" trigger</b>. This means Odoo will propose replenishment in "
"your replenishment dashboard, but you must manually approve them before\n"
"                                the orders are created. To skip this manual "
"approval step and have Odoo automatically create orders, simply set the "
"Reordering Rules to an <b>\"Auto\" trigger</b>."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນນີ້, <b>ກົດການສັ່ງຊື້ຄືນ</b> ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນແບບ <b>ຕົວກະຕຸ້ນ \"ກຳນົດເອງ\" "
"(Manual)</b>. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ Odoo ຈະສະເໜີການເຕີມສິນຄ້າໃນໜ້າປັດການເຕີມສິນຄ້າ, "
"ແຕ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງອະນຸມັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງກ່ອນ\n"
"                                ທີ່ຈະມີການສ້າງໃບສັ່ງ. ເພື່ອຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນການອະນຸມັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງນີ້ "
"ແລະ ໃຫ້ Odoo ສ້າງໃບສັ່ງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ພຽງແຕ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າກົດການສັ່ງຊື້ຄືນໃຫ້ເປັນ <b>ຕົວກະຕຸ້ນ "
"\"ອັດຕະໂນມັດ\" (Auto)</b>."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model:product.attribute.value,name:textile_manufacturing.product_attribute_value_7
msgid "Indigo"
msgstr "ສີຄາມ"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model:product.template,name:textile_manufacturing.product_template_17
msgid "Interfacing (Woven)"
msgstr "ຜ້າກາວຮອງ (ແບບທໍ)"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"It's usually better to start with a greater number of individual products "
"and fewer variants. Once you're confident in your workflow and automation "
"needs, you can then combine these products into a single product with "
"multiple\n"
"                    variants. This approach allows you to build a more "
"robust and scalable system without the added complexity of variants from the "
"start."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແລ້ວ ມັນຈະດີກວ່າຖ້າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການສ້າງສິນຄ້າດ່ຽວໆເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍກວ່າ ແລະ ມີລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍໜ້ອຍລົງ. "
"ເມື່ອທ່ານໝັ້ນໃຈໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ລະບົບອັດຕະໂນມັດແລ້ວ, "
"ທ່ານຈຶ່ງຄ່ອຍຮວມສິນຄ້າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຂົ້າເປັນສິນຄ້າດຽວທີ່ມີຫຼາຍ\n"
"                    ລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍ. ວິທີນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງລະບົບທີ່ມີຄວາມໝັ້ນຄົງ ແລະ ຂະຫຍາຍຕົວໄດ້ງ່າຍ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄວາມສັບສົນເລື່ອງລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

