#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <b>Inventory app</b> allows you to manage all of your stock operations, "
"including inputs, outputs, and internal movements. When you validate a "
"purchase or sales order, a corresponding receipt or delivery is "
"automatically created."
msgstr ""
"<b>ແອັບສາງສິນຄ້າ</b> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຄຸ້ມຄອງການດຳເນີນງານທັງໝົດກ່ຽວກັບສິນຄ້າໃນສາງ, "
"ລວມທັງການຮັບເຂົ້າ, ການເບີກອອກ, ແລະ ການຍ້າຍພາຍໃນ. ເມື່ອທ່ານຢືນຢັນໃບສັ່ງຊື້ ຫຼື ໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ, "
"ໃບຮັບສິນຄ້າ ຫຼື ໃບສົ່ງມອບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Convert button appears only when specific criteria are met to ensure "
"data integrity:"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມ ແປງສະພາບ ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນສະເພາະເມື່ອກົງຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂທີ່ກຳນົດເທົ່ານັ້ນ "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງສົມບູນຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ:"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Odoo <b>Inventory</b> module is very powerful. While many great features "
"are available, it's best to start with a simple process and add new features "
"only after you've had time to test them."
msgstr ""
"ໂມດູນ <b>ສາງສິນຄ້າ</b> ຂອງ Odoo ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງຫຼາຍ. ເຖິງວ່າມີຄຸນສົມບັດດີໆຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃຫ້ເລືອກໃຊ້, "
"ແຕ່ມັນຈະດີທີ່ສຸດຖ້າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຂະບວນການງ່າຍໆ ແລະ ຄ່ອຍເພີ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ທົດສອບພວກມັນແລ້ວ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Replenishment view gives you a clear overview of all current and future "
"needs (you can adjust the <b>Horizon settings</b> to see what's coming up). "
"From this screen, you can directly create purchase orders, subcontracting "
"orders, or\n"
"            manufacturing orders."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມມອງການເຕີມສິນຄ້າຈະສະແດງພາບລວມທີ່ຊັດເຈນຂອງຄວາມຕ້ອງການທັງໝົດໃນປະຈຸບັນ ແລະ ອະນາຄົດ "
"(ທ່ານສາມາດປັບ <b>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າກອບເວລາ (Horizon)</b> ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການທີ່ຈະມາເຖິງໄດ້). "
"ຈາກໜ້າຈໍນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຊື້, ໃບສັ່ງຈ້າງຜະລິດພາຍນອກ, ຫຼື\n"
"            ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The barcode app can be installed as a standalone application on devices. "
"This means people can use it without having access to the rest of the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບບາໂຄດສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງເປັນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນສະເພາະເທິງອຸປະກອນຕ່າງໆໄດ້. "
"ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າພະນັກງານສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນອື່ນໆຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "The customer reminders."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The delivery for these orders will be created automatically from the "
"<b>Sales Order</b>."
msgstr "ການສົ່ງມອບສຳລັບໃບສັ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກ <b>ໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ</b>."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "The financial reporting."
msgstr "ການລາຍງານທາງດ້ານການເງິນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The process for creating a production order is similar for both <b>Engineer-"
"to-Order (ETO)</b> and <b>Make-to-Order (MTO)</b> products. To allow for "
"greater flexibility in choosing the correct <b>Bill of Materials (BOM)</b> "
"and making\n"
"            any needed adjustments, you must manually create a manufacturing "
"order after a sales order is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"ຂະບວນການສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັນສຳລັບທັງສິນຄ້າແບບ <b>Engineer-to-Order (ETO)</b> ແລະ "
"<b>Make-to-Order (MTO)</b>. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນການເລືອກ <b>ໂຄງສ້າງວັດຖຸດິບ "
"(BOM)</b> ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ດຳເນີນການ\n"
"            ປັບປ່ຽນຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ, "
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຫຼັງຈາກໃບສັ່ງຂາຍໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "The production process is identical until the final customization step."
msgstr "ຂະບວນການຜະລິດແມ່ນຄືກັນຈົນຮອດຂັ້ນຕອນການປັບແຕ່ງສຸດທ້າຍ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "The synchronisation with the banks."
msgstr "ການຊິ້ງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນກັບທະນາຄານ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "The vendor bills payment."
msgstr "ການຊຳລະໃບບິນຜູ້ສະໜອງ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"This feature relies on additional lines of code, which may affect your "
"subscription cost."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຂຶ້ນກັບໂຄ້ດເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເຊິ່ງອາດມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄ່າບໍລິການລົງທະບຽນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This flexibility allows you to manage different production processes for the "
"same product, making it easy to use existing inventory when possible."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຄຸ້ມຄອງຂະບວນການຜະລິດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບສິນຄ້າດຽວກັນ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ສິນຄ້າທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນສາງໄດ້ງ່າຍເມື່ອເປັນໄປໄດ້."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model:product.template,name:textile_manufacturing.product_template_23
msgid "Thistle & Rose, Sample"
msgstr "ລາຍ Thistle & Rose, ຕົວຢ່າງ"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "Tips for success:"
msgstr "ເຄັດລັບສູ່ຄວາມສຳເລັດ:"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"To create a new Bill of Materials from scratch, you'll need to know that "
"there are two distinct types: <b>Production BOMs</b> (for in-house "
"production) and <b>Subcontracting BOMs</b> (for external production). Each "
"type requires\n"
"            different settings."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງໂຄງສ້າງວັດຖຸດິບໃໝ່ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຮູ້ວ່າມັນມີສອງປະເພດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ: <b>BOM "
"ການຜະລິດ</b> (ສຳລັບການຜະລິດພາຍໃນ) ແລະ <b>BOM ຈ້າງຜະລິດພາຍນອກ</b> "
"(ສຳລັບການຜະລິດພາຍນອກ). ແຕ່ລະປະເພດຕ້ອງການ\n"
"            ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model:project.task.type,name:textile_manufacturing.project_task_type_11
msgid "To do"
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດ"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"To get a rapid understanding of the processes this Odoo package offers, you "
"can execute the following flows and configure the settings to suit your "
"production."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃຈຂະບວນການຕ່າງໆທີ່ຊຸດ Odoo ນີ້ມີໃຫ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ, ທ່ານສາມາດປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ແລະ "
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບການຜະລິດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "To get started:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"To include all the necessary information, such as the logo to be printed, "
"technical measurements, and other details, you can choose one of two methods:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮວມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດ ເຊັ່ນ: ໂລໂກ້ທີ່ຈະພິມ, ຂະໜາດທາງເຕັກນິກ, ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດອື່ນໆ, "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໜຶ່ງໃນສອງວິທີນີ້:"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "To make your workflow even more efficient, explore these features:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງທ່ານມີປະສິດທິພາບຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນ, ລອງຄົ້ນຫາຄຸນສົມບັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"To plan your orders, go to the manufacturing app, select them, and click "
"\"Plan.\" The system will then generate a detailed schedule that accounts "
"for the capacity of your <b>work centers</b>. You can see a clear overview "
"of your schedule\n"
"            on the planning by work centers screen."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອວາງແຜນໃບສັ່ງຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແອັບການຜະລິດ, ເລືອກໃບສັ່ງ, ແລ້ວກົດ \"ວາງແຜນ\" (Plan). "
"ຈາກນັ້ນລະບົບຈະສ້າງຕາຕະລາງລະອຽດທີ່ຄິດໄລ່ຕາມກຳລັງການຜະລິດຂອງ <b>ສູນປະຕິບັດງານ</b> ຂອງທ່ານ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງພາບລວມທີ່ຊັດເຈນຂອງຕາຕະລາງ\n"
"            ໄດ້ໃນໜ້າຈໍການວາງແຜນຕາມສູນປະຕິບັດງານ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"To provide maximum flexibility during warehouse operations, a new Convert "
"button is now available on transfer from the backend and from the barcode "
"app."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນສູງສຸດໃນລະຫວ່າງການດຳເນີນງານໃນສາງ, ປຸ່ມ ແປງສະພາບ (Convert) ໃໝ່ "
"ແມ່ນພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວໃນໃບໂອນຍ້າຍຈາກລະບົບຫຼັງບ້ານ (backend) ແລະ ຈາກແອັບບາໂຄດ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model:product.category,name:textile_manufacturing.product_category_5
msgid "Tops"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງນຸ່ງສ່ວນເທິງ"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use barcode scanners to validate stock movements, identify pallet positions, "
"and perform fast, accurate stock operations. Greatly improves warehouse "
"efficiency and reduces human error."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງສະແກນບາໂຄດເພື່ອຢືນຢັນການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍສິນຄ້າ, ລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງພາເລັດ, ແລະ "
"ດຳເນີນການຈັດການສິນຄ້າໃນສາງໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ ແລະ ຖືກຕ້ອງ. "
"ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບຂອງສາງສິນຄ້າໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈາກຄົນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <b>PLM app</b> to review and update your Bills of Material (BOMs) at "
"the right time."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ <b>ແອັບ PLM</b> ເພື່ອກວດສອບ ແລະ ອັບເດດໂຄງສ້າງວັດຖຸດິບ (BOMs) ຂອງທ່ານໃນເວລາທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "Use the <strong>Accounting</strong> app to easily handle:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ແອັບ <strong>ການບັນຊີ</strong> ເພື່ອຈັດການສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ:"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "Uses a consistent and repeatable production process."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຂະບວນການຜະລິດທີ່ສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ ແລະ ສາມາດເຮັດຊໍ້າໄດ້."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Utilizes a <b>standard BOM</b> with options for small <b>customization</b>."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ <b>BOM ມາດຕະຖານ</b> ພ້ອມຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບ <b>ການປັບແຕ່ງ</b> ເລັກນ້ອຍ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model:product.attribute.value,name:textile_manufacturing.product_attribute_value_8
msgid "Violet"
msgstr "ສີມ່ວງອ່ອນ (Violet)"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model:project.project.stage,name:textile_manufacturing.project_project_stage_5
msgid "Waiting client validation"
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າການຢືນຢັນຈາກລູກຄ້າ"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.view_page_home
msgid ""
"We believe great fabric shouldn't sit in a drawer. Whether you're making a "
"garment, reupholstering a chair, or piecing together a quilt, our goal is "
"simple: connect makers with prints that can't be found anywhere else."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາເຊື່ອວ່າຜ້າທີ່ດີບໍ່ຄວນຖືກປະໄວ້ໃນຕູ້. ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະຕັດຫຍິບເສື້ອຜ້າ, ຫຸ້ມເກົ້າອີ້ໃໝ່, ຫຼື ຫຍິບຜ້າຫົ່ມຕໍ່ລາຍ, "
"ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງພວກເຮົາແມ່ນງ່າຍດາຍ: ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜູ້ສ້າງສັນກັບລວດລາຍພິມທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຊອກຫາໄດ້ຈາກບ່ອນອື່ນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"We believe history shouldn't sit behind glass:&amp;nbsp;it should be worn, "
"sewn, and used."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາເຊື່ອວ່າປະຫວັດສາດບໍ່ຄວນຢູ່ພຽງແຕ່ຫຼັງຕູ້ແກ້ວ:&amp;nbsp;ມັນຄວນຖືກນຸ່ງ, ຖືກຫຍິບ, ແລະ ຖືກນຳໃຊ້."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"We don't mass-produce. Once a bolt sells out, it's gone — which means every "
"purchase is part of a limited, ever-changing collection."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ຜະລິດເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ເມື່ອມ້ວນຜ້າຂາຍໝົດແລ້ວ ກໍຄືໝົດເລີຍ — "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທຸກໆການຊື້ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊຸດສະສົມທີ່ມີຈຳນວນຈຳກັດ ແລະ ປ່ຽນແປງໃໝ່ຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"We respect the mills, printers, and designers who created these patterns."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາເຄົາລົບໂຮງງານທໍ, ໂຮງພິມ, ແລ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"We track down vintage and classical fabrics with a focus on Scottish floral "
"heritage — from hand-printed chintz to toile-inspired botanicals, heather "
"and thistle motifs, and tartan-influenced florals. Every piece is inspected "
"for quality and authenticity before it reaches our shelves, so you can trust "
"what you're getting is genuine, wearable, and ready to use."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຊອກຫາແຜ່ນແພແບບວິນເທຈ ແລະ ຄລາດສິກ ໂດຍເນັ້ນໃສ່ມໍລະດົກລວດລາຍດອກໄມ້ຂອງສະກັອດແລນ — "
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ຜ້າຊີ້ນສ໌ພິມດ້ວຍມື ໄປຈົນເຖິງລາຍພຶກສາສາດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແຮງບັນດານໃຈຈາກຕົວລ໌ (toile), "
"ລວດລາຍດອກເຮດເທີ ແລະ ດອກທິສເຊິລ, ຕະຫຼອດຮອດລາຍດອກໄມ້ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອິດທິພົນຈາກຜ້າຕາໂກ່ (tartan). "
"ທຸກໆຊິ້ນຜ່ານການກວດສອບຄຸນນະພາບ ແລະ ຄວາມແທ້ຈິງ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະນຳມາວາງເທິງຊັ້ນວາງຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"ທ່ານຈຶ່ງໝັ້ນໃຈໄດ້ວ່າສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບນັ້ນແມ່ນຂອງແທ້, ສາມາດນຸ່ງຖືໄດ້ ແລະ ພ້ອມນຳໃຊ້."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"We’ve set up a <b>\"Polo with Quality Level\"</b> product to demonstrate "
"this process. Open delivery <b>WH/OUT/00002</b> (Red Polo). Imagine 20 of "
"the 40 units were water-damaged in storage and cannot be sold as Premium "
"stock."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າສິນຄ້າ <b>\"ເສື້ອໂປໂລ ພ້ອມລະດັບຄຸນນະພາບ\"</b> ເພື່ອສະແດງຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້. "
"ເປີດໃບສົ່ງສິນຄ້າ <b>WH/OUT/00002</b> (ເສື້ອໂປໂລສີແດງ). ສົມມຸດວ່າ 20 ໃນຈຳນວນ 40 ຜືນ "
"ເສຍຫາຍຍ້ອນຖືກນ້ຳໃນສາງ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຂາຍເປັນສິນຄ້າລະດັບພຣີມຽມໄດ້."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.footer_custom
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"What started as a personal collection grew into something we wanted to "
"share: a place where makers, collectors, and lovers of textile history could "
"find fabric that simply isn't made anymore."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກການສະສົມສ່ວນຕົວ ໄດ້ເຕີບໃຫຍ່ກາຍມາເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຢາກແບ່ງປັນ: ສະຖານທີ່ທີ່ບັນດາຜູ້ຜະລິດ, "
"ນັກສະສົມ ແລະ ຜູ້ທີ່ຮັກໃນປະຫວັດສາດແຜ່ນແພ ສາມາດຊອກຫາຜ້າທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຜະລິດອີກແລ້ວ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When you create a manufacturing order for a specific variant, such as a "
"\"Yellow\" T-shirt, the system automatically pulls only the necessary "
"materials—in this case, the <b>Yellow Cotton</b> and the <b>Clothing Label</"
"b>. This approach\n"
"            helps streamline the production process and ensures you only use "
"the components needed for each specific version of the product."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດສຳລັບລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍສະເພາະ, ເຊັ່ນ: ເສື້ອຍືດ \"ສີເຫຼືອງ\", "
"ລະບົບຈະດຶງສະເພາະວັດຖຸດິບທີ່ຈຳເປັນມາໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ — ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ແມ່ນ <b>ຜ້າຝ້າຍສີເຫຼືອງ</b> ແລະ "
"<b>ປ້າຍຕິດເສື້ອຜ້າ</b>. ວິທີການນີ້\n"
"            ຊ່ວຍເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະບວນການຜະລິດມີຄວາມຄ່ອງຕົວຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ຮັບປະກັນວ່າທ່ານນຳໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບສິນຄ້າແຕ່ລະຮູບແບບສະເພາະເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "When you're ready to manage a transfer:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຈັດການການໂອນຍ້າຍສາງ:"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When you're ready, create a <b>Manufacturing Order</b> specifically for the "
"pattern and initiate production (don't link a Bill of Materials (BOM) for "
"this one, as it doesn't have one)"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານພ້ອມແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ <b>ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ</b> ສະເພາະສຳລັບຮູບແບບນັ້ນ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຜະລິດ "
"(ຢ່າເຊື່ອມໂຍງລາຍການວັດຖຸດິບ (BOM) ສຳລັບລາຍການນີ້, ຍ້ອນວ່າມັນບໍ່ມີ)"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When you're ready, you have the flexibility to create an invoice for either "
"a full or a partial payment, such as a down payment. All invoices generated "
"are tracked and can be managed through the <b>Invoices app</b>."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານພ້ອມແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກສ້າງໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ໄດ້ທັງແບບເຕັມຈຳນວນ ຫຼື ແບບບາງສ່ວນ, ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ການຊຳລະເງິນມັດຈຳ. ໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ທັງໝົດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະຖືກຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້ຜ່ານ <b>ແອັບໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້</"
"b>."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"While the system allows broad product-to-product conversion, you can enforce "
"strict rules using the <b>\"Convert Attribute\"</b> setting:"
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າລະບົບຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແປງປ່ຽນລະຫວ່າງສິນຄ້າໄດ້ຢ່າງກວ້າງຂວາງ, "
"ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດກົດເກນທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ <b>\"ແປງຄຸນລັກສະນະ\"</b>:"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"While you can manually move an operation with a simple drag and drop, keep "
"in mind this change is isolated to that specific work order and will not re-"
"plan the others."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າທ່ານສາມາດຍ້າຍການດຳເນີນງານດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ ໂດຍການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ, "
"ແຕ່ຄວນຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງນີ້ຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບໃບສັ່ງວຽກນັ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີການວາງແຜນໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບລາຍການອື່ນໆ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model:product.attribute.value,name:textile_manufacturing.product_attribute_value_13
msgid "White"
msgstr "ສີຂາວ"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model:product.template,name:textile_manufacturing.product_template_27
msgid "Wildflower Toile, Sample"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຜ້າຕົວລ໌ດອກໄມ້ປ່າ"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "Within the <strong>Inventory App</strong>"
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ <strong>ແອັບສາງສິນຄ້າ</strong>"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Working with Bill of Materials (BOM) variants is a great way to automate the "
"replenishment of specific components. However, this approach can add "
"complexity and make it difficult to simplify your product structure later on."
msgstr ""
"ການເຮັດວຽກກັບລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍຂອງລາຍການວັດຖຸດິບ (BOM) "
"ເປັນວິທີທີ່ດີໃນການຕື່ມສ່ວນປະກອບສະເພາະແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ວິທີການນີ້ອາດເພີ່ມຄວາມສັບສົນ "
"ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ຍາກໃນການປັບປ່ຽນໂຄງສ້າງສິນຄ້າຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປຶກສາກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Odoo ຂອງທ່ານກັບພວກເຮົາ ຫຼື ພັດທະນາຕື່ມອີກບໍ່?"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.view_page_contactus
msgid "Write your message"
msgstr "ຂຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງທ່ານ"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.footer_custom
msgid "X"
msgstr "X"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model:product.attribute.value,name:textile_manufacturing.product_attribute_value_4
msgid "Yellow"
msgstr "ສີເຫຼືອງ"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You also have the flexibility to invoice for these services at any point, or "
"even include them for free if the client agrees to the final quote."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລືອກອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ສຳລັບການບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ, ຫຼື ແມ່ນແຕ່ຮວມເຂົ້າແບບບໍ່ຄິດໄລ່ເງິນ "
"ຖ້າລູກຄ້າຕົກລົງເຫັນດີກັບໃບສະເໜີລາຄາສຸດທ້າຍ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກໆແອັບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Odoo ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ທີ່ໜ້າກະດານຫຼັກ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can assign one or more employees to each operation. This makes them "
"visible on the planning schedule and links the operations to the correct "
"workers in the shop floor app."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດມອບໝາຍພະນັກງານໜຶ່ງຄົນ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍຄົນໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະການດຳເນີນງານໄດ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຕາຕະລາງການວາງແຜນ ແລະ "
"ເຊື່ອມໂຍງການດຳເນີນງານໄປຫາຜູ້ປະຕິບັດງານທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນແອັບພື້ນທີ່ຜະລິດ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can choose to charge a standard price for your design work or track the "
"time spent and bill the client later."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກທີ່ຈະຄິດໄລ່ລາຄາມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບວຽກອອກແບບຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ຕິດຕາມເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ໄປ "
"ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນນຳລູກຄ້າໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can create multiple Bills of Materials (BOMs) for the same finished "
"product. This is useful for products that can be made in different ways."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງລາຍການວັດຖຸດິບ (BOM) ໄດ້ຫຼາຍລາຍການສຳລັບສິນຄ້າສຳເລັດຮູບອັນດຽວກັນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບສິນຄ້າທີ່ສາມາດຜະລິດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can customize the settings for each operation type within the barcode "
"application to control what is permitted during the process. This allows you "
"to define specific rules for operations like picking, ensuring the\n"
"                        barcode functionality aligns with your business "
"workflow."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບແຕ່ລະປະເພດການດຳເນີນງານພາຍໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນບາໂຄດ "
"ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມສິ່ງທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດກົດເກນສະເພາະສຳລັບການດຳເນີນງານ ເຊັ່ນ: ການເກັບສິນຄ້າ, ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າ\n"
"                        ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງບາໂຄດສອດຄ່ອງກັບຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງທຸລະກິດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can easily invoice clients directly from a <b>Sales Order</b>. Each "
"order allows you to set specific <b>payment terms and conditions</b> "
"tailored to that client or project."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ ໂດຍກົງຈາກ <b>ໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ</b>. "
"ແຕ່ລະໃບສັ່ງຂາຍອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດ <b>ເງື່ອນໄຂການຊຳລະເງິນ</b> ສະເພາະທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບລູກຄ້າ ຫຼື "
"ໂຄງການນັ້ນໆ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can print <b>barcode commands</b> to streamline your operations with "
"quick scanning actions."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດພິມ <b>ຄຳສັ່ງບາໂຄດ</b> ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການດຳເນີນງານຂອງທ່ານວ່ອງໄວຂຶ້ນ "
"ດ້ວຍການສະແກນຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ."

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You didn't import demo data? You can still do it. Go to Apps &gt; Industries "
"&gt; Upgrade your Textile Manufacturing package and select the relevant "
"checkbox"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງແມ່ນບໍ່? ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້. ໄປທີ່ ແອັບ &gt; ອຸດສາຫະກຳ &gt; "
"ອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດ Textile Manufacturing ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ໝາຍເອົາຫ້ອງເລືອກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Your dynamic snippet will be displayed here... This message appears because "
"you haven't provided enough options to retrieve its content.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"ສະນິບເປັດແບບໄດນາມິກຂອງທ່ານຈະສະແດງຢູ່ນີ້... "
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ປາກົດຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນວ່າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຕົວເລືອກພຽງພໍທີ່ຈະດຶງເອົາເນື້ອຫາຂອງມັນ.<br/>"

